1. 准备工作目录 yoctoproject 并进入
mkdir ~/yoctoproject
cd yoctoproject

2. 拉取poky 和 本仓库
git clone git://git.yoctoproject.org/poky
git clone https://github.com/Meqjn-Ousapva/meta-loongarch.git
or
git clone https://gitee.com/meqjn_ousapva/meta-loongarch.git

3. poky 与 本仓库 设置在相同分支上，比如 nanbield/kirkstone
cd ~/yoctoproject/poky
checkout nanbield
cd ~/yoctoproject/meta-loongarch
checkout nanbield

4. 进入 poky 仓库运行 `source oe-init-build-env ../build`
会自动进入到  ~/yoctoproject/build 目录下

5. 添加 meta-loongarch 路径到 conf/bblayers.conf
打开 conf/bblayers.conf 将 meta-loongarch 仓库路径添加在最前面
（添加到最前面可以保证bbclass被覆盖）
```
# POKY_BBLAYERS_CONF_VERSION is increased each time build/conf/bblayers.conf
# changes incompatibly
POKY_BBLAYERS_CONF_VERSION = "2"

BBPATH = "${TOPDIR}"
BBFILES ?= ""

BBLAYERS ?= " \
  /home/meqjn/yoctoproject/meta-loongarch \
  /home/meqjn/yoctoproject/poky/meta \
  /home/meqjn/yoctoproject/poky/meta-poky \
  /home/meqjn/yoctoproject/poky/meta-yocto-bsp \
  "
```

6. 将 meta-loongarch 下的 config/local.conf.sample 替换 build 下 config/local.conf
cp ~/yoctoproject/meta-loongarch/config/local.conf.sample ~/yoctoproject/build/config/local.conf

7. 在 build 目录下运行 `bitbake core-image-minimal` 

8. 结束后在 tmp/deploy/images/qemuloongarch64/ 下看到生成的 rootfs.tar.bz2

